}, {"name": "One more verse", "bars": 4, "kind": "listen", "lines": ["Drink the water, cool and clear,", "Shady tree is very near.", "Camel, camel, rest a while,", "Give the sun a sleepy smile."]}, {"name": "Last turn", "bars": 4, "kind": "turn", "lines": []}, {"name": "All together", "bars": 4, "kind": "listen", "lines": ["Camel, camel, home at last,", "Journey slow, but journey past.", "Camel, camel, wave goodbye,", "Under the starry desert sky."]}, {"name": "Outro", "bars": 2, "kind": "listen", "lines": []}]}, "lyrics": "[Listen]\nCamel, camel, walking far,\nUnder the sun, under the star.\nCamel, camel, one big hump,\nSway and sway, bump, bump.\n\n[Listen again]\nSandy hills go up and down,\nCamel walks to the next town.\nBells go ring and drums go dum,\nHere the happy camels come.\n\n[Together]\nRide with me, a desert ride,\nSwaying gently side to side.\nCamel, camel, one, two, three,\nSing this desert song with me.\n\n[One more verse]\nDrink the water, cool and clear,\nShady tree is very near.\nCamel, camel, rest a while,\nGive the sun a sleepy smile.\n\n[All together]\nCamel, camel, home at last,\nJourney slow, but journey past.\nCamel, camel, wave goodbye,\nUnder the starry desert sky."}, {"track": 9, "title": "Animal Parade", "level": 3, "tune": {"bpm": 108, "beats_per_bar": 4, "notes": [{"pitch": "C4", "start": 0, "length": 1}, {"pitch": "E4", "start": 1, "length": 1}, {"pitch": "G4", "start": 2, "length": 1}, {"pitch": "A4", "start": 3, "length": 1}, {"pitch": "G4", "start": 4, "length": 1}, {"pitch": "E4", "start": 5, "length": 1}, {"pitch": "C4", "start": 6, "length": 1}, {"pitch": "C4", "start": 8, "length": 1}, {"pitch": "E4", "start": 9, "length": 1}, {"pitch": "G4", "start": 10, "length": 1}, {"pitch": "A4", "start": 11, "length": 1}, {"pitch": "G4", "start": 12, "length": 1}, {"pitch": "E4", "start": 13, "length": 1}, {"pitch": "C4", "start": 14, "length": 1}]}, "plan": {"bpm": 108, "beats_per_bar": 4, "key": "C major", "styles": ["bright marching b